{"parentUuid":"e1a4d8de-4e5c-4316-b6a1-6e78c0bebc11","isSidechain":false,"type":"system","subtype":"away_summary","content":"On vérifie ton flipper avant de rebrancher la Power Driver, en commençant par le bip entre TP6 (+50 V) et la masse. Prochaine action : cordon débranché, mesure en ohms entre TP6 (pointe rouge) et TP5, puis donne-moi la valeur stable. (disable recaps in /config)","timestamp":"2026-10-25T12:21:01.619Z","uuid":"b3a2cb80-5563-4cd0-b316-bad36651ea85","isMeta":false,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\sources\\the-shadow-pinball-troubleshoot","sessionId":"67a0b140-c89f-4ca5-be8f-b924fa2c867f","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"golden-gathering-hearth"}
