on conformes (calibre, type), porte-fusibles abîmés | Inventaire | À faire |"," | R7 | Dégâts résiduels sur la PD (TIP36C, TIP102, 2N5401, diodes D5–D12 et D17–D32, BR3, ponts de soudure, composants remplacés mal orientés) | Contrôle sur banc | À faire |"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"5550d633-bbca-4b44-9d41-0fd9b07af171","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"67a0b140-c89f-4ca5-be8f-b924fa2c867f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\sources\\the-shadow-pinball-troubleshoot","sessionId":"67a0b140-c89f-4ca5-be8f-b924fa2c867f","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"golden-gathering-hearth"}
