lors d'une réparation (H6, H2) | Réparations antérieures sur la \n180:| K4 | Sortie commandée trop longtemps : U5, Q71, Q81, blanking, CPU (H4) | Souvenir de transistors qui chauffaient\n181:| K5 | F105 de calibre trop élevé, qui a laissé durer le courant (≈ 10 A) | F105 difficile à retirer (O3) : a-\n182:| K6 | Fil Violet-Marron en contact avec un 50 V : court-circuit franc dès la mise en conduction | Rien à ce stade","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"b4aca12e-f73c-485f-8107-98c5af4e6e55","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/c/sources/the-shadow-pinball-troubleshoot","root":null,"branch":null,"default_branch":null,"status":null,"visibility":{"origin":null,"push_remote":null,"remotes":[],"visibility_cache":[]},"error":"not_a_repo"},"live_cwd":"/c/sources/the-shadow-pinball-troubleshoot","platform":"windows"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"1974b916-06af-4b81-8ce8-18db4cb38eb3","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"67a0b140-c89f-4ca5-be8f-b924fa2c867f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\sources\\the-shadow-pinball-troubleshoot","sessionId":"67a0b140-c89f-4ca5-be8f-b924fa2c867f","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"golden-gathering-hearth"}
