es (comparée à Sol 07 et Sol 08), état de l'enveloppe, des cosses et des fils (traces de chauffe : la bobine a pu rester alimentée plusieurs secondes, O7)."," "," ## 9. Questions en suspens"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false,"contentNotInModelContext":true},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"01565b4b-e3b9-4728-81ca-f03b788eba43","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"67a0b140-c89f-4ca5-be8f-b924fa2c867f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\sources\\the-shadow-pinball-troubleshoot","sessionId":"67a0b140-c89f-4ca5-be8f-b924fa2c867f","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"golden-gathering-hearth"}
