{"parentUuid":"7ea34545-0b25-4917-9eff-7cc3b4e62dab","isSidechain":false,"type":"system","subtype":"away_summary","content":"On vérifie le flipper avant de rebrancher la Power Driver réparée, et on cherche quel fusible alimente la bobine Sol 01, qui n'est pas sur F105. Prochaine action : débrancher J107 et mesurer en ohms entre le fil Violet‑Marron de J130 et chaque fil de J107.","timestamp":"2026-10-25T14:53:59.889Z","uuid":"2e9e13a2-64ca-4afd-8e16-85ad7d09a80d","isMeta":false,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\sources\\the-shadow-pinball-troubleshoot","sessionId":"67a0b140-c89f-4ca5-be8f-b924fa2c867f","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"golden-gathering-hearth"}
