{"parentUuid":"84e9de35-25d7-4166-912c-70bde13c8825","isSidechain":false,"type":"system","subtype":"away_summary","content":"On vérifie le flipper avant de rebrancher la Power Driver, et on confirme que seul F104 alimente la bobine Sol 01. Prochaine étape : hors tension, mesure en ohms entre le fil Violet‑Marron de J130 et TP6 (attendu : OL).","timestamp":"2026-10-25T15:04:26.837Z","uuid":"f4d1bb7e-9aaf-4301-913a-7fcc7be5fa21","isMeta":false,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\sources\\the-shadow-pinball-troubleshoot","sessionId":"67a0b140-c89f-4ca5-be8f-b924fa2c867f","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"golden-gathering-hearth"}
