{"parentUuid":"b17c8ac6-2185-4156-906c-4052aa31190b","isSidechain":false,"type":"system","subtype":"away_summary","content":"Objectif : tout vérifier avant de rebrancher la Power Driver ; on contrôle maintenant la bobine Sol 01, dont le transistor Q82 a lâché. Prochaine action : lever le plateau et vérifier le sens de sa diode et sa résistance.","timestamp":"2026-10-25T15:17:02.067Z","uuid":"491f3701-7cc5-4378-a278-ab7024492de9","isMeta":false,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\sources\\the-shadow-pinball-troubleshoot","sessionId":"67a0b140-c89f-4ca5-be8f-b924fa2c867f","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"golden-gathering-hearth"}
