{"parentUuid":"3e068f41-b0de-4fec-8b79-cc7d457dac99","isSidechain":false,"type":"system","subtype":"away_summary","content":"On sécurise ta Power Driver avant de la rebrancher ; on cherche maintenant pourquoi la Sol 01 est alimentée par F104 et non F105. Prochaine action : noter la couleur du fil d'alimentation de la bobine Sol 08.","timestamp":"2026-10-25T15:33:42.655Z","uuid":"1f398517-e8fe-405f-bb05-6dc1f8cc3b2f","isMeta":false,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\sources\\the-shadow-pinball-troubleshoot","sessionId":"67a0b140-c89f-4ca5-be8f-b924fa2c867f","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"golden-gathering-hearth"}
